sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff as Tenant staff browser
    participant UI as Admin CRUD screen
    participant BFF as Next.js admin API route
    participant API as NestJS controller
    participant Guard as Auth, role, permission, ownership
    participant Service as Tenant service
    participant DB as Tenant database
    participant Audit as Audit event writer

    Staff->>UI: Edit a tenant resource
    UI->>BFF: Submit validated form
    BFF->>BFF: Normalize payload and preserve tenant host
    BFF->>API: Send authenticated mutation
    API->>Guard: Authenticate and authorize action
    Guard-->>API: Staff principal and tenant scope
    API->>Service: Execute domain command
    Service->>DB: Validate ownership and write transaction
    DB-->>Service: Updated resource
    Service->>Audit: Record actor, tenant, action, resource
    Audit-->>Service: Evidence accepted
    Service-->>API: Response DTO
    API-->>BFF: Success or typed domain error
    BFF-->>UI: Refresh/invalidate affected view
    UI-->>Staff: Updated state or actionable error

    Note over Guard,DB: Permission checks and ownership checks remain server-side.